.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-check 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-check \- Run the applicable read\-only gates against the repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten check\fR [\fB\-\-rule\fR] [\fB\-\-staged\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the applicable read\-only gates against the repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-rule\fR
Run only the declared rules with these ids (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-staged\fR
Judge only the paths staged in the git index
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR
Judge only the paths changed against this rev
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
